{"id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function.md","title":"Buchholz Collapsing Function","display":"df-buchholz-collapsing-function — Buchholz Collapsing Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","aliases":["18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","18-df-058"],"display":"df-buchholz-collapsing-function — Buchholz Collapsing Function","depends_on":["[[18-df-collapsing-closure]]","[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definition 9.4.1; §9.5 definition of B and ψ; §9.6 (B3)","source_printed_pages":"173; 181; 183","source_pdf_pages":"183; 191; 193","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function</span><span>18-df-058</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-buchholz-collapsing-function — Buchholz Collapsing Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" href=\"?note=6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" title=\"18-df-collapsing-closure\">18-df-collapsing-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 9.4.1; §9.5 definition of B and ψ; §9.6 (B3)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"173; 181; 183"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"183; 191; 193"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\alpha)\">\\(C(\\alpha)\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" href=\"?note=6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" title=\"18-df-collapsing-closure\">18-df-collapsing-closure</a> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 是同一节点同时递归引入的可定义类函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega\\)</span>，不是预先假定的集合函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n \\psi(\\alpha)=\\min\\bigl(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\bigr)&lt;\\Omega.\">\\(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n \\psi(\\alpha)=\\min\\bigl(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\bigr)&lt;\\Omega.\\)</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书先对 Cantorian closed 算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_H\">\\(\\psi_H\\)</span>，再取 p.181 的最小 Veblen 闭包算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi=\\psi_B\">\\(\\psi=\\psi_B\\)</span>。本节点复述上游已经同时定义的同一函数的接口；不作第二次递归定义。该函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=B\">\\(H=B\\)</span> 特例，不把任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的崩塌函数混为同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>根据上游的可数性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；序数良序保证唯一最小值。原书使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\{\\xi:\\xi\\notin B_\\alpha\\}\">\\(\\min\\{\\xi:\\xi\\notin B_\\alpha\\}\\)</span>；由于最小遗漏值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>，与此处表达等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-collapsing-closure","status":"resolved","id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-collapsing-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-collapsing-closure","status":"resolved","id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C(\\alpha)$ 由 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]] 定义。$\\psi$ 是同一节点同时递归引入的可定义类函数 $\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega$，不是预先假定的集合函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n \\psi(\\alpha)=\\min\\bigl(\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\bigr)<\\Omega.","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_H","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi=\\psi_B","display":false},{"tex":"H=B","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\setminus C(\\alpha)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\{\\xi:\\xi\\notin B_\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"3cb367216d9bd61d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；$\\psi:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega$ 是 [[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 的 Veblen 闭包崩塌函数。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]]"},{"id":"1c1dcb6d897f9b41","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$、$\\psi$ 为 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]]、[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 中同时递归定义的类函数。"},{"id":"50076d54977c5fd6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$、$\\psi$ 为 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]]、[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 中同时递归定义的类函数。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]]"}],"outgoing":["6b3f52af2d45c0ea","cf95026e035bcb2b"]}